        "created_at": "2013-03-13T13:04:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>La Capitan places cards under her if she or one of her crew members destroys them.&nbsp; Omnitron X has components that get destroyed if he is dealt 5 or more damage in a single turn.&nbsp; If OX takes 5 damage in a turn from La Capitan or her crew, do his components get destroyed by himself and go to his trash, or by LC and go beneath her?&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:36.463Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
