        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-13T13:15:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is a very good question which could probably use an official ruling.&nbsp; I suppose it would apply to Expatriette's Flak Jacket as well.</p><p>However, my guess is that the answer is no.&nbsp; The card&nbsp;is technically being destroyed by an effect written on a hero card.&nbsp; Plus, answering yes raises the question of what happens if the 5 damage comes from more than one source.</p>",
